    "title": "NCDOT says parts of NC12 remain closed due to ocean overwash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago DARE COUNTY, N.C. (WITN) - The North Carolina Department of Transportation says that parts of NC12 reman closed. According to the NCDOT, the areas between the Basnight Bridge and Rodanthe, as well as on Ocracoke between the ferry terminal and the pony pens are still closed. The road is open elsewhere, but the DOT says they are experiencing sound side flooding in places like the Tri-Villages and Hatteras. Read full article\n10",
